@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

title Create Trade - Maturity Date Validation

actor Client
participant "API" as API
participant "Pydantic\nValidator" as Validator

Client -> API: POST /api/v1/trades\n{maturity_date: "2020-01-01"}
activate API

API -> Validator: Validate TradeCreate
activate Validator

Validator -> Validator: Check maturity_date\n2020-01-01 < today

Validator --> API: ValidationError\n"Maturity date cannot\nbe in the past"
deactivate Validator

API --> Client: HTTP 422\nUnprocessable Entity\n{\n  "detail": [\n    {\n      "msg": "Maturity date\n      cannot be in the past"\n    }\n  ]\n}
deactivate API

@enduml
